  orderBubbles:
  - Three tourney days exhausted Sir Aldric before he fell.
  - His stitched chest gash still leaves him shivering violently.
  - He cannot lift his goblet, though his heartbeat stays steady.
  - His brow is cool, with no fever.
  - His squire requested Syzygium aromaticum for shivering.
  - He paired it with Cinnamomum for muscle fatigue.
  firstHerbId: herb.clove
  secondHerbId: herb.cinnamon
